## CHAPTER 1: PROJECT OVERVIEW

### Description
The Fortress Hub is a comprehensive receipt-to-analytics platform designed for handymen, contractors, and small business owners. It processes receipt images through OCR, extracts key data, and provides real-time analytics.

### Key Features
- 📸 Instant receipt capture (mobile, web, desktop)
- 🧠 AI-powered OCR with Google Gemini
- 📊 Real-time spending analytics
- 🎯 Auto-categorization of expenses
- 📱 Cross-platform (iOS, Android, Web, Desktop)
- 🔒 Secure storage with AWS S3
- 📈 Tax report generation

### Technology Stack
| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| **Backend** | Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL, Redis |
| **AI/OCR** | Google Gemini Vision API |
| **Storage** | AWS S3 |
| **Frontend** | React, Recharts, TailwindCSS |
| **Mobile** | React Native |
